# PR product demos

For **complex features** or **user-facing behavioral changes**, the PR is not review-ready until it includes a **product demo** that shows the feature working end-to-end.

## When “complex” applies

Use the **same heuristics** as [trigger-ui-verifier-demo](./trigger-ui-verifier-demo.mdc) (BDD verifier is separate and still required when that rule applies — demos do not replace it):

- New or changed user flow (commands, modals, settings, status, errors, permissions)
- **Large change heuristic:** ≥3 non-test files under `src/ui/`, `src/hooks/`, plugin settings tab, or `styles.css`
- Any user-facing `[Unreleased]` changelog bullet for behavior or UI

## Required evidence

- Record or capture on the **Cursor Cloud VM** (not local-only proof when cloud is available).
- Attach walkthrough media to the PR so reviewers can validate without a checkout:
  - **Screen recording (`.mp4`)** — **required** for complex features and user-facing flows (multi-step interaction, animation, modal/settings/status changes, anything the verifier exercises). **Screenshots-only is not enough** for review-ready PRs in those cases.
  - **Screenshots** — sufficient only for **static** layout/copy proof with no interaction story (still pair with CLI/eval when behavior changed).
  - Artifacts must be **embedded in the PR description** (inline video/images), not only on the agent run dashboard or in chat.
- During the recording or live walkthrough, run the **UI jank pass** in [obsidian-visual-verify](../../skills/obsidian-visual-verify/SKILL.md) and [ux-design](../../skills/ux-design/SKILL.md) — fail the demo if jank is ship-blocking.
- Use git-ignored paths (`.tmp/`, `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` on cloud) for capture files; never commit demo binaries.
- **Pacing:** After each visible state or behavior change (panel open, tab switch, message sent, error shown, etc.), **pause at least 2 seconds** on that state before moving to the next demo step so reviewers can read and follow the transition.

## How to attach

Follow [obsidian-cloud-vm-demos](../../skills/obsidian-cloud-vm-demos/SKILL.md): Cloud Agent artifact posting and/or `gh pr edit --body-file … --attach ./demo.mp4`.

Functional BDD verification (happy + unhappy paths, PASS/FAIL report with failure explanations): delegate **`/ui-verifier-demo`** per [trigger-ui-verifier-demo](./trigger-ui-verifier-demo.mdc) and [obsidian-ui-verifier-demo](../../skills/obsidian-ui-verifier-demo/SKILL.md). Include `ui-verifier-demo-report.md` in PR or chat when behavioral scope is large.

Before **🟠 Requires user input**, delegate **`/pr-acceptance-review`** per [obsidian-pr-acceptance-review](../../skills/obsidian-pr-acceptance-review/SKILL.md): PR body must include **`## Acceptance review`** with **Verdict: PASS** and all AC checkboxes checked.

## When it can be skipped

Local-only request, zero UI/behavior impact, or cloud demo blocked (env/secrets) — say what was verified instead.
